1198 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I got into web development the way most people do\054 messing around and building things\056 What kept me going was realizing how much the front end actually matters\056 Not just visually\054 but architecturally\056\n\nHow you structure components\054 how a team scales a codebase\054 how a doctor using a medical portal at 2am needs things to just work\072 that\047s what interests me more than chasing the latest framework\056\n\nI care a lot about the details\054 the kind users don\047t notice when they\047re right\054 but feel immediately when they\047re wrong\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1199 0 R
     /Pg 1188 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
